e\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"His life came to an end during the Siege of Syracuse, when he was killed by a Roman soldier despite orders from the Roman general, Marcus Claudius Marcellus, that he should not be harmed.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF3zb5xIqs2w8FpLVOOe5lnAs-nbaIrmYtj3MZ3NDNNInnuuzR284QYai4LsGVLIuKKXLQ6118uNH-8PQkbv-b0pPxHpddx0HCjO1jvjm9WXnQirNFNDTSBXtMlP2NQYYwPhuoZFzQ_nDSZ\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":10,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Calculus and Pi:** He anticipated modern calculus by using concepts like infinitesimals and the method of exhaustion to prove geometrical theorems.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdMlFyw3nn8fjLyVuklmaNJZVRTmabNIr-KlWAiU811u8idSk6a6Q6BpwbFkDKeVfU-RZ39vNGacFWPpQG95A1g0U_-HkWHxaoqbHSGajbgXVm5fUj5kMv3SITYzwxrSZl1gc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":11,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"This allowed him to accurately calculate the area of a circle, the surface area and volume of a sphere, and the area under a parabola.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdMlFyw3nn8fjLyVuklmaNJZVRTmabNIr-KlWAiU811u8idSk6a6Q6BpwbFkDKeVfU-RZ39vNGacFWPpQG95A1g0U_-HkWHxaoqbHSGajbgXVm5fUj5kMv3SITYzwxrSZl1gc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":12,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"He also derived a famously accurate approximation of the mathematical constant pi (\\u03c0).\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEks3xHtg5-2ZAGfIqOnx78QFTBUoDMNjue2ABQsrbe_J7lLiVucf44tJRJ5UcQ_QM6ncOMpHYorD3gs92p67ROZQ0CH5vt9LIjGLTbEklFVeOdMmgIK86ghsxasYdvHBk=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":13,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Large Numbers:** In his work *The Sand Reckoner*, Archimedes devised a system to express very large numbers, demonstrating that mathematics could represent numbers far greater than the grains of sand needed to fill the universe.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdMlFyw3nn8fjLyVuklmaNJZVRTmabNIr-KlWAiU811u8idSk6a6Q6BpwbFkDKeVfU-RZ39vNGacFWPpQG95A1g0U_-HkWHxaoqbHSGajbgXVm5fUj5kMv3SITYzwxrSZl1gc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":14,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedean Spiral:** He defined and investigated the properties of the spiral that now bears his name.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdMlFyw3nn8fjLyVuklmaNJZVRTmabNIr-KlWAiU811u8idSk6a6Q6BpwbFkDKeVfU-RZ39vNGacFWPpQG95A1g0U_-HkWHxaoqbHSGajbgXVm5fUj5kMv3SITYzwxrSZl1gc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":15,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"It states that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward buoyant force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEks3xHtg5-2ZAGfIqOnx78QFTBUoDMNjue2ABQsrbe_J7lLiVucf44tJRJ5UcQ_QM6ncOMpHYorD3gs92p67ROZQ0CH5vt9LIjGLTbEklFVeOdMmgIK86ghsxasYdvHBk=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":16,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"It states that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward buoyant force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF3zb5xIqs2w8FpLVOOe5lnAs-nbaIrmYtj3MZ3NDNNInnuuzR284QYai4LsGVLIuKKXLQ6118uNH-8PQkbv-b0pPxHpddx0HCjO1jvjm9WXnQirNFNDTSBXtMlP2NQYYwPhuoZFzQ_nDSZ\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":17,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **The Law of the Lever:** He provided a mathematical proof for the law of the lever and is credited with the famous quote, \\\"Give me a place to stand, and I shall move the Earth.\\\"\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdMlFyw3nn8fjLyVuklmaNJZVRTmabNIr-KlWAiU811u8idSk6a6Q6BpwbFkDKeVfU-RZ39vNGacFWPpQG95A1g0U_-HkWHxaoqbHSGajbgXVm5fUj5kMv3SITYzwxrSZl1gc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":18,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"He also developed fundamental theorems concerning the center of gravity of various shapes.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG0t9zMJ-W0rlGNXcorFd16M2T2l_jG_hiHsdh3PABXJ5DaufZD0m_lhszbgrWp6wyDktgU1k7SWDBALCw15BaY4sHqyjdRmtLljrfbqEMmOF5LJhezDH3SXMEPgwWxRhKqfK8H3buuozWyGPr_t_KuPDN_6FuHWNo=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":19,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"worldhistory.org\",\"data\":\"He is credited with designing the **Archimedes' screw**, a device for raising water that is still in use today.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG7Sgx-L5Jp2WfzHS6x8IlgwkGjViUy0e8KMlhTIVThLhnup4GBKyuiEci66vx_99byLdS6OgBQD8PQyuJ_LVeb2BXrfHHjQW0trwjPlahttdVfsUwLvnHhl20DaRHh7MXx1rM=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":20,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"He is credited with designing the **Archimedes' screw**, a device for raising water that is still in use today.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF3zb5xIqs2w8FpLVOOe5lnAs-nbaIrmYtj3MZ3NDNNInnuuzR284QYai4LsGVLIuKKXLQ6118uNH-8PQkbv-b0pPxHpddx0HCjO1jvjm9WXnQirNFNDTSBXtMlP2NQYYwPhuoZFzQ_nDSZ\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":21,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"He also created compound pulleys, which allow heavy objects to be moved with less force, and is said to have developed an early version of an odometer to measure distance.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdMlFyw3nn8fjLyVuklmaNJZVRTmabNIr-KlWAiU811u8idSk6a6Q6BpwbFkDKeVfU-RZ39vNGacFWPpQG95A1g0U_-HkWHxaoqbHSGajbgXVm5fUj5kMv3SITYzwxrSZl1gc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":22,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"He also created compound pulleys, which allow heavy objects to be moved with less force, and is said to have developed an early version of an odometer to measure distance.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEks3xHtg5-2ZAGfIqOnx78QFTBUoDMNjue2ABQsrbe_J7lLiVucf44tJRJ5UcQ_QM6ncOMpHYorD3gs92p67ROZQ0CH5vt9LIjGLTbEklFVeOdMmgIK86ghsxasYdvHBk=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":23,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **War Machines:** During the Roman siege of Syracuse, Archimedes designed innovative defensive war machines that long delayed the city's capture.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdMlFyw3nn8fjLyVuklmaNJZVRTmabNIr-KlWAiU811u8idSk6a6Q6BpwbFkDKeVfU-RZ39vNGacFWPpQG95A1g0U_-HkWHxaoqbHSGajbgXVm5fUj5kMv3SITYzwxrSZl1gc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":24,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **War Machines:** During the Roman siege of Syracuse, Archimedes designed innovative defensive war machines that long delayed the city's capture.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF3zb5xIqs2w8FpLVOOe5lnAs-nbaIrmYtj3MZ3NDNNInnuuzR284QYai4LsGVLIuKKXLQ6118uNH-8PQkbv-b0pPxHpddx0HCjO1jvjm9WXnQirNFNDTSBXtMlP2NQYYwPhuoZFzQ_nDSZ\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"content\":\"\"}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"delta\":{}}],\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":10,\"completion_tokens\":838,\"total_tokens\":848},\"id\":\"c3b408b6-0455-4266-af27-1fc49aab9879\",\"created\":1770896673,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: [DONE]\n\n",
